      "interpretation": "The first learned component is mean-like and the second is a stable early-to-late contrast. The contrast alone is insufficient, but mean plus contrast gives a small repeated balanced gain. Ranks 3 and 4 do not improve on rank 2. Expanding the matched covariance cap to 2048 yields the clearest independent-decoding gain."
